    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man nyithindho mir Israel utimo gin ma rac kendo i wang’ Yehova, man Yehova kethogi i cing’ Jufilisti rundi pier ang’wen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ng’atu moko nuti m’i Zora, mi wat mi Judani, ma nyinge Manoa; man dhaku pare mugumba kwanye, man enyol ungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man malaika pa Yehova wok ba dhakune, man ewacu ire kumae, Nen kawono, mugumba kwenyi, man inyol ungo; ento ibigamu ii, man ibinyolo nyathin ma nico. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno kawono gwokri giri, akwei, man kud imadh pigulok kadi giramadha ma lake tek, man kud icam gin moko m’ucido: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.6.1+NUM.6.2+NUM.6.3+NUM.6.4+NUM.6.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 6:1-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kum, nen, ibigamu ii, man ibinyolo nyathin ma nico; man riedi bitundo i wie ki ngo; kum nyathinne bibedo Janaziri ni Mungu ugambre kud i ic: man ebimaku laru Israel kud i cing’ Jufilisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhakune lund ubino eyero ni cware, ewacu kumae, Dhanu pa Mungu bino i bang’a, man wang’e bedo va wang’ malaika pa Mungu, m’ung’oi ndiri; man apenje ngo pi ka m’eai i ie, kadok nyinge de eyero ira ngo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento ewacu ira kumae, Nen, ibigamu ii, man ibinyolo nyathin ma nico; e kawono kud imadh pigulok moko kadi giramadha ma lake tek, man kud icam gin moko m’ucido; kum nyathin bibedo Janaziri ni Mungu ugambre kud i ic cil i ceng’ mi tho pare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manoa lund ukwayu Yehova, man ewacu kumae, A, Rwoth, akwei, wek dhanu pa Mungu m’ioro ubin kendo i bang’wa, man eponjwa maram wabitimo ko kum nyathin ma jubinyolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Mungu winjo dwand Manoa; man malaika pa Mungu bino kendo ba dhaku nwang’u eni i podho: ento Manoa ma cware ni karacelo kude ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man dhakune timo pio, man eringo, man eyero ni cware, ewacu ire kumae, Nen, ng’atuca wok i bang’a, en e ng’atu ma nyamaca bino i bang’a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Manoa ai malu, man elubo tok dhaku pare, e ebino ba ng’atuca, man ewacu ire kumae, In i ng’atu m’uyero lembe ni dhaku? Man ewacu kumae, An a en. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Manoa wacu kumae, Kawono wek lembe peri tjmbre kakare: nyathin maeni bibedo nenedi, man wabitimo ire nenedi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man malaika pa Yehova wacu ni Manoa kumae, Gin ceke m’ayero pire ni dhaku wek egwokre gire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kud ecam gin moko m’uai bang’ ulok, kadok pigulok kadi giramadha ma lake tek de kud emadhi, kadi kud ecam gin moko m’ucido; gin ceke m’ang’olo ire wek ekwire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Manoa wacu ni malaika pa Yehova kumae, Akwei, wek waceri, kara wayik nyathi diel iri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man malaika pa Yehova wacu ni Manoa kumae, Kadok icera, abicamu kum kwen peri ngo; man tek ibiyiko lam m’awang’a, ibikothiere be ni Yehova. Kum Manoa ng’eyo ngo nia en e malaika pa Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Manoa wacu ni malaika pa Yehova kumae, Nyingi ng’a, kara, ka lembe peri timbre kakare wayungi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man malaika pa Yehova wacu ire kumae, Nedi ipenjo nyinga, kum en e nying’ mi wang’uici? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno Manoa gamu nyathi diel karacelo ku lam mi mogo, man ethiere wi kidi ni Yehova: man malaika timo ma wang’u ijo; man Manoa ku dhaku pare gineno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum etimbre, kinde ma lebmac uidho malu i polo ku ba pemblam, nia malaika pa Yehova idho kud i lebmac mi pemblam: man Manoa ku dhaku pare gineno; e gipodho arieba wang’gi i ng’om.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento malaika pa Yehova wok kendo ngo ba Manoa kadi ba dhaku pare. E Manoa lund ung’eyo nia e malaika pa Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Manoa wacu ni dhaku pare kumae, Wabitho andha, kum waneno Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento dhaku pare wacu ire kumae, Tek Yehova yenyo enegwa, kuno di k’ejolo lam m’awang’a ku lam mi mogo de ngo kud i cingwa, kadok gin maeni ceke de kuno di k’enyutho iwa ngo, kadok wagi gin ma kumeni de kuno di k’eyero ngo i nindo maeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man dhakune nyolo nyathin ma nico, man elwong’o nyinge Samson: man nyathin udongo, e Yehova mio mugisa ire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Tipo pa Yehova maku ting’o cwinye i Mahanedan i kind Zora kud Ectaol.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
